      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.64",
      "verse": 64,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when they had blindfolded him, they struck him on the face, and asked him, saying, Prophesy, who is it that smote thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.65",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.65",
      "verse": 65,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And many other things blasphemously spake they against him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.66",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.66",
      "verse": 66,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ And as soon as it was day, the elders of the people and the chief priests and the scribes came together, and led him into their council, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.67",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.67",
      "verse": 67,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Art thou the Christ? tell us. And he said unto them, If I tell you, ye will not believe:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.68",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.68",
      "verse": 68,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if I also ask ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ye will not answer me, nor let ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " go.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.69",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.69",
      "verse": 69,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hereafter shall the Son of man sit on the right hand of the power of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.70",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.70",
      "verse": 70,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then said they all, Art thou then the Son of God? And he said unto them, Ye say that I am.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUK.22.71",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:LUK.22.71",
      "verse": 71,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they said, What need we any further witness? for we ourselves have heard of his own mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
